<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108119" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβῐβ-άζω</span></b> , Causal of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβαίνω,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>draw</i> or <i>bring
			down</i>: Medic., <i>carry off downwards,</i> i. e. <i>by
				purging,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τὰ χολώδη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				6.6.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>stoop</i> or <i>crouch down,</i> of a horse that
			lowers itself to take up the rider, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				6.16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.213
			</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόβασις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>lower, humble,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i><span class="en">
				Music.
			</span></i>, <i>transpose lower,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερβ.,</span> Theo Sm.<i><span class="en">
				p.92
			</span></i> H. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of numbers, <i>to be in a descending series,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>in Nic.</u>
				p.53
			</span></i> P.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
